==Battleground==
*1 [[God of War - Odin (Enemy)|Odin]] spawns as the boss after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Junior God Brynhildr (Enemy)|Brynhildr]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Junior God Suruzu (Enemy)|Suruzu]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*1 [[Goddess of Abundance - Freya (Enemy)|Freya]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Junior God of Light - Valkyrie (Enemy)|Valkyries]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 40~60 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Junior God of Light - Valkyrie (Enemy)|Valkyries]] spawn after 93.33 seconds<sup>2,800f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Junior God of Light - Valkyrie (Enemy)|Valkyries]] spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The hardest stage in Yurudrasil Divine!, everything here is at a rather mid~high magnification. Junior God of Light - Valkyrie is the main peon in this level, God of War - Odin being the main threat with 550,000 health, 15,500 damage and 555 range, meaning that he'll outrange most units that you have!! [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long Distance units]] such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hacker Cat]] can help on getting rid of Odin while your other attackers will deal with the remaining enemies.

==Trivia==
*Nyagnarok is a pun on にゃん ''nyan'' (meow) and ''[[wikipedia:Ragnarök|Ragnarök]]'', an apocalyptic event in Norse mythology.

